<item><title>World Bank pledges $700 million more for Niger as Kandadji project restarts</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ne/world-bank-pledges-700-million-more-for-niger-as-kandadji-e67317/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ne/world-bank-pledges-700-million-more-for-niger-as-kandadji-e67317/</guid><category>Niger</category><description>The World Bank plans to add about $700 million in public funding to its existing Niger portfolio of more than $4 billion over the next five years.</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 16:01:56 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ne/world-bank-pledges-700-million-more-for-niger-as-kandadji-e67317/share.jpg" length="43998" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ne/world-bank-pledges-700-million-more-for-niger-as-kandadji-e67317/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
